      "product_summary": "Factory-direct supply supports competitive wholesale quotations based on style, quantity, materials, size ratio and packing. OEM/ODM support includes custom logo, color and packaging options. Pre-shipment checks cover product appearance, size assortment and order quantity. Production and dispatch are arranged promptly after specifications are confirmed. Samples can be discussed for product and fit evaluation before bulk orders.",
